  "detail_text": "The Department of the Interior will host an Industry Day on March 27, 2026, at 11:00 am at the Main Interior Building (1849 C Street NW, Washington, DC 20240). Details are in the attached Special Notice; additional details will be provided in future amendments to this notice and posted at SAM.gov. Interested parties should email the completed registration form to Sarah_Welch@nps.gov and Jaime_mijares@nps.gov no later than 11:00 AM MDT March 23, 2026. NAICS Code 315210: Cut and sew apparel contractors Small business size standard: 750 employees Product Service Group 84: Clothing, Individual Equipment, and Insignia and Jewelry; primarily 8415: Clothing, Special Purpose",
